# Code owners for the FOTTP website.
#
# Editors (via the Sveltia CMS) may publish changes to page and news content
# on their own. Anything else -- layouts, site config, the CMS config, the
# deploy workflow, docs -- needs review from a code owner before it can merge.
#
# This only takes effect once the branch ruleset on `main` requires review
# from code owners (see docs/HANDOFF.md, "Access and review").
#
# The last matching pattern wins, and a pattern with no owner means "no review
# needed", so `/content/` below opens up just that folder.
#
# TODO: add the second owner (or an org team, e.g. @fottp/website-owners) on
# the first line once decided; a code owner can't approve their own changes.

